          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakusanyike mataifa yote, kabila zote wakutanike; ni nani miongoni mwao awezaye kuhubiri neno hili, na kutuonyesha mambo ya zamani? Na walete mashahidi wao, wapate kuhesabiwa kuwa na haki; au na wasikie, wakaseme, Ni kweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
