        {
          "text": "Ninyi ni mashahidi wangu, asema BWANA, na mtumishi niliyemchagua; mpate kujua, na kuniamini, na kufahamu ya kuwa mimi ndiye; kabla yangu hakuumbwa Mungu awaye yote, wala baada yangu mimi hatakuwapo mwingine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
